    "node": {
      "__id__": 691
    },
    "_enabled": true,
    "__prefab": {
      "__id__": 695
    },
    "_lineHeight": 45,
    "_string": "<img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> are evaluated when they land on screen. If multiple <img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> land on screen, they are evaluated\none at a time. Before a <img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> is evaluated, all previously evaluated <img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> will transform into <img src=\"45\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/>.\n\nRemaining spins will be played only if there are positions that do not contain <img src=\"45\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> nor <img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/>. If all\npositions are held, the value displayed in the GRAND jackpot meter is awarded.\n\nAn alternate set of reels is used during the Matsuri Feature. All symbols appearing on the reels\nexcept for <img src=\"45\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> and <img src=\"44\" width=60 height=60 offset=-7/> are grayed out and not evaluated. The distribution of prizes changes\nwith bet option. Credit prizes appearing on screen are awarded as shown.",
    "_horizontalAlign": 1,
    "_verticalAlign": 1,
    "_fontSize": 26,
    "_fontColor": {
      "__type__": "cc.Color",
      "r": 255,
      "g": 255,
